--
-- What this tier owns: SCORING RETRIEVAL AND ANSWERS HONESTLY. Average
-- precision and MAP, the no-relevant rule and the relevance threshold; DCG,
-- the ideal ranking, linear and exponential gain and unjudged passages; SQuAD
-- normalisation, exact match and token F1; field extraction by outcome with
-- micro and macro figures; groundedness, cited and retrieved, and its limits;
-- two systems compared with a seeded paired bootstrap. Digest sections 11 to
-- 16, and section 24.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A setting changes the verdict: the threshold
-- reverses the MAP order of the two systems, grounded is not correct, and a
-- difference inside its interval is not a finding.
-- ============================================================================

